			"name": "Total Communion (Sol Mahina)",
			"local_notes": "Dedicated relationship feature [0] within the established paid architecture; not generic free telepathy.\n\n**Status:** Dedicated relationship-specific operating rule, recorded as a [0] feature of the established architecture.\n\nSol receives Tsar's complete conscious experiential state continuously and involuntarily: senses, thoughts, emotions, body schema, compartments, recalled memories, Mindscapes, telepresence, incoming familiar streams, and reactions.\n\nThere is no selection, concealment, falsification, delay, or redaction while this dedicated communion exists. Ending it requires severing the dedicated communion. Tsar receives Sol through the Familiar Bond.\n\nThis differs from Tsar's ordinary deliberately selected outbound Telesend. Recursive Perspective Integrity applies to their nested mutual awareness.",
